只输出严格JSON，恰好包含id（metadata.id原样）、summary_zh（15到140个Unicode字符，通常40到100字）、category（枚举）、tags（2到5个不重复关键词，每个最多30字符）、confidence（0到1，仅自评）、insufficient_evidence（布尔）、evidence（1到3个对象，每个恰好包含paragraph_id、fact）、limitations（0到5个字符串）。只选择输入中长度20至120字符的完整片段编号；fact是该片段支持的中文事实转述。不要输出quote，不要自行抄写、拼接、删改或补造引用。程序会按编号附上原文。一个编号只用一次；最多3条证据。不得增加字段。
摘要和limitations保留会改变功能意义的前提、平台例外和限制：设密码后才认证、页面保持打开才提醒、依赖外部组件、估算不等于保证。只写已实现功能，不将规划当完成。证据不足就标记，不编造。
图像识别/分类不是媒体创作，没有贴切类别归other；量化、计算与领域研究归search-research，不因多智能体实现归agents-automation；模型/CLI适配与插件开发工具归coding-development；市场/精选目录按搜索发现归search-research。不要按附属同步、备份或评论功能分类。不要推断本机客户端等于本地模型。
摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Plugin marketplace for DeepSeek Harness Web settings: install, update and remove plugins across any local profile.","id":"gh:1335275762","install_available":true,"language":"TypeScript","name":"dsh-plugin-market","slug":"springbrand-lab/dsh-plugin-market","topics":["deepseek-harness","dsh-plugin","plugin-marketplace"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Plugin marketplace for DeepSeek Harness Web settings: install, update and remove plugins across any "},{"id":"p1s2","text":"lace for DeepSeek Harness Web settings: install, update and remove plugins across any local profile."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# @springbrand/dsh-plugin-marketplace"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"English | 中文"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"The visual plugin marketplace built into DeepSeek Harness Web settings and bundled with SpringBrand "},{"id":"p4s2","text":"Desktop. Open **Settings → Plugin Marketplace** to browse and search the catalog, then install, upda"},{"id":"p4s3","text":"te, or remove plugins."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"## Install from scratch"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"You do not need DSH preinstalled."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"1. Install the LTS version of Node.js, then close and reopen your terminal.\n2. Install DSH and pnpm:"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"3. Confirm that DSH is available:"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"4. Install the marketplace:"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"5. Start DSH Web:"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"Keep the terminal open. Your browser normally opens automatically; otherwise, open the `http://127.0"},{"id":"p15s2","text":".0.1:...` address printed in the terminal. Then go to **Settings → Plugin Marketplace**."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"If `dsh` is still not found after reopening the terminal, use:"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"## Already have DSH?"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"## What you get"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"- **Browse and search** by name, author, description, or npm package, with visible plugin categories"},{"id":"p21s2","text":", repository avatars, and compact GitHub Star counts.\n- **Profile management** across `web`, `headle"},{"id":"p21s3","text":"ss`, and other local profiles under ordinary DSH; SpringBrand Desktop limits operations to its activ"},{"id":"p21s4","text":"e profile.\n- **Install, update, and remove in one place**, with exact installed versions, visible up"},{"id":"p21s5","text":"date badges and counts, and one-click updates to the latest published version.\n- **Installed view** "},{"id":"p21s6","text":"covering both catalog entries and profile dependencies that are not listed in the catalog.\n- **Marke"},{"id":"p21s7","text":"tplace self-updates in SpringBrand Desktop** by installing the latest release into the active profil"},{"id":"p21s8","text":"e; removing that profile override falls back to the version bundled with the app.\n- **Clear activati"},{"id":"p21s9","text":"on timing**: changes to the current profile restart DSH automatically; changes to other profiles app"},{"id":"p21s10","text":"ly on their next launch."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"## Security"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"- Installation is limited to catalog entries marked `bundle`, `installable`, and `npm`.\n- The server"},{"id":"p23s2","text":" resolves the npm package name from the catalog again instead of accepting an arbitrary source from "},{"id":"p23s3","text":"the browser.\n- Updates and removals accept only valid npm package names already installed in the sel"},{"id":"p23s4","text":"ected profile.\n- Mutation endpoints accept same-origin JSON POST requests only, with an 8 KiB body l"},{"id":"p23s5","text":"imit.\n- Ordinary DSH commands are launched with argument arrays, never through a shell. SpringBrand "},{"id":"p23s6","text":"Desktop delegates to its managed package-operation service. Only one plugin operation runs at a time"},{"id":"p23s7","text":"esktop delegates to its managed package-operation service. Only one plugin operation runs at a time."},{"id":"p24s1","text":"Plugins are third-party code. Catalog inclusion is not a security endorsement; install only sources "},{"id":"p24s2","text":"e third-party code. Catalog inclusion is not a security endorsement; install only sources you trust."},{"id":"p25s1","text":"## How it works"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"Under ordinary DSH, the marketplace targets the running profile by default and can select another pr"},{"id":"p27s2","text":"ofile in the UI. SpringBrand Desktop exposes only its active profile, runs package operations throug"},{"id":"p27s3","text":"h `desktopPnpm`, and requests an orderly application restart through `desktopProfiles`. Third-party "},{"id":"p27s4","text":"plugins use `runPlugin()` so DSH reconciles their bundle layers. The marketplace's own profile overr"},{"id":"p27s5","text":"ide uses direct `run()` because its row already belongs to Desktop; reconciling it as another bundle"},{"id":"p27s6","text":" would duplicate that row. The plugin does not provide arbitrary hot-mounting or seamless port hando"},{"id":"p27s7","text":"uld duplicate that row. The plugin does not provide arbitrary hot-mounting or seamless port handoff."},{"id":"p28s1","text":"### Which profiles appear as targets"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"Under ordinary DSH the profile list is `web`, `headless`, the profile this process was launched with"},{"id":"p29s2","text":", and every directory under `<DSH home>/profiles`, sorted by name. The DSH home is `DSH_HOME` when s"},{"id":"p29s3","text":"et, otherwise `~/.dsh`. `profiles/node_modules` is never offered as a target."},{"id":"p30s1","text":"A profile appears in the list before it has been initialized, so a plugin can be installed into `hea"},{"id":"p30s2","text":"dless` from a `web` session without creating the profile first. What the **Installed** view reports "},{"id":"p30s3","text":"for each profile is that profile's own `package.json` dependency map — which is why it also lists pa"},{"id":"p30s4","text":"ckages that were installed outside this marketplace and are absent from the catalog. SpringBrand Des"},{"id":"p30s5","text":"ktop also reports the marketplace version bundled with the app; its first self-update creates a prof"},{"id":"p30s6","text":"ile dependency that takes precedence after restart."},{"id":"p31s1","text":"## Configuration"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"Override these fields in the profile's Cordis configuration:"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"- `profile`: the profile used by an ordinary DSH process; read from the launch arguments by default."},{"id":"p34s2","text":" SpringBrand Desktop always uses its active profile.\n- `catalogUrl`: the plugin catalog JSON URL; HT"},{"id":"p34s3","text":"TP and HTTPS are supported.\n- `restartDelayMs`: delay before restarting an ordinary DSH process, fro"},{"id":"p34s4","text":"m 500 to 30000 milliseconds. SpringBrand Desktop owns its restart timing."},{"id":"p35s1","text":"## Uninstall"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"Remove the package from the marketplace's Installed tab, or run:"},{"id":"p37s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p38s1","text":"## Development"},{"id":"p39s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p40s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p41s1","text":"MIT"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
